:: A4 Skuttle Talk 1 [dialogue act4 char-Skuttle] {"position":"570,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "You approach the tiny shack with caution. As you get closer you see the hodge-podge of corrugated iron, timber planks, rotted netting and discarded plastics from whihc this makeshift shelter has been assembled. As you reach out to touch the rusted metal exterior, a slat in the iron facade is yanked open with a metallic screech. A pair of eyes stare back intensely at you.">>
<<say "Skuttle" "Stop right there!" "commanding">>
<<stage "You flinch back, and do as the nasal voice commands.">>
<<say "Skuttle" "Who sent you!?">>
<<reply "Um...">>
<<say "Skuttle" "WHO SENT YOU, DAMNIT!?" "screeching">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "Nobody?" "A4 Skuttle Talk 2a" -5>>
<<reply "The Oceanography Council?" "A4 Skuttle Talk 2b" -5>>
<</choices>>


:: A4 Skuttle Talk 2a [dialogue act4 char-Skuttle] {"position":"570,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<say "Skuttle" "That's what they all say! Now answer me this: Were you followed!? Spotted!? Clocked!? Trailed!? Stalked!? Spied!? Seen in situ!? Sent by THEM!???">>
<<stage "You struggle to remember.">>
<<say "Skuttle" "Who sent you!?">>
<<reply "Um...">>
<<say "Skuttle" "WHO SENT YOU, DAMNIT!?" "screeching">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "Nobody?" "A4 Skuttle Talk 2a" -5>>
<<reply "The Oceanography Council?" "A4 Skuttle Talk 2b" -5>>
<</choices>>

