:: A3 Gumboh Talk 6a [dialogue act3 char-Gumboh] {"position":"1350,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "You wrench open the viewport of your diving helmet and tilt the bowl gently to your lips.">>
<<stage "A simple Seaweed Soup. It tastes...">>
<<stage "Amazing! It's only a humble broth but the variety of flavours and textures are unlike anything you've ever tasted. This Gumboh is the real deal!">>
<<reply "Gumboh, this soup is incredible!">>
<<stage "Gumboh chuckles bashfully and returns to their cauldron.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Too kind. Seawood Soup is simple. Impossible to taste wrong!" "shyly">>
<<say "Gumboh" "But every day Seawood Soup... It can make the flavour disappear." "upset">>
<<reply "What do you mean?">>
<<say "Gumboh" "In Gumboh's kitchen we are proud to serve the best food from across all the ocean. So our people, humble people, eat the same as the Kings. Since the city become divided, it's impossible to find ingredients. Impossible to mix flavours. So... " "sadly">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Seawood Soup every day. And little of it.">>
<<reply "What if I can help? I could procure you ingredients from the other districts?" 5>>
<<say "Gumboh" "You could? That would mean... Everything. I will keep kitchen open. If you find something, bring it to me here. Thank you, friend! Thank you!" "lighting up">>
