:: A3 Gumboh Talk 6b [dialogue act3 char-Gumboh] {"position":"1350,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "Gumboh bows their head in defeat. They slowly withdraw the bowl and cup it in their large hands.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "A simple Seaweed Soup. I'm afraid we have nothing else." "crestfallen">>
<<stage "Gumboh gently places the bowl on the kitchen surface.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "I leave it here for you. If you change your mind.">>
<<reply "Why do you only have Seaweed Soup?">>
<<say "Gumboh" "It's not always been this way.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "In Gumboh's kitchen we are proud to serve the best food from across all the ocean. So our people, humble people, eat the same as the Kings. Since the city become divided, it's impossible to find ingredients. Impossible to mix flavours. So... " "sadly">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Seawood Soup every day. And little of it.">>
<<reply "What if I can help? I could procure you ingredients from the other districts?">>
<<stage "Gumboh looks down at you with tired eyes.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Another joke." "blankly">>
<<stage "Gumboh returns to their caldron.">>
<<reply "I'm not joking this time!">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Ok, friend. I keep Gumboh's kitchen open late tonight. If I find new fresh ingredients here, then I believe you, ok?" "tired">>
